WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.765 --> 00:00:15.315
Bello: why did you do that?

2
00:00:15.335 --> 00:00:18.177
Tina: Trust me, I know what I'm doing.

3
00:00:18.197 --> 00:00:20.159
Bello: I hope so.

4
00:00:20.179 --> 00:00:22.981
Tina: Bello, do you know how to jump rope?

5
00:00:23.001 --> 00:00:24.503
Bello: Sure.

6
00:00:24.803 --> 00:00:26.805
Back in Ginormous, I was good at it.

7
00:00:27.125 --> 00:00:29.367
Why? Tina: Watch me.

8
00:00:33.036 --> 00:00:33.897
Bello: I can do that!

9
00:00:33.917 --> 00:00:39.060
Tina: Now we can untie these knots!

10
00:00:46.945 --> 00:00:49.106
Okay. Now we can save the boys!

11
00:00:49.686 --> 00:00:52.168
Bello: All the mites are going inside the tower.

12
00:00:53.048 --> 00:00:55.310
Bello: We need to lock the door so they can't get out.

13
00:00:55.330 --> 00:00:58.552
Tina: And we need to find a way to get the boys down!

14
00:01:05.516 --> 00:01:08.359
Bello: We can use this to block the door from the outside.

15
00:01:08.379 --> 00:01:11.401
Tina: Bello, that's a great idea.

16
00:01:11.421 --> 00:01:15.145
Bello: Let's go!

17
00:01:15.165 --> 00:01:19.308
Tina: Okay.

18
00:01:19.549 --> 00:01:20.269
They're all in.

19
00:01:20.289 --> 00:01:21.731
Bello: Help me.

20
00:01:21.751 --> 00:01:27.736
Tina: Great.

21
00:01:27.756 --> 00:01:32.000
Bello: Now we need to get Danny and Brad out of the tower.

22
00:01:33.352 --> 00:01:36.914
Tina: If we can find something to catch them with, then they can jump.

23
00:01:36.934 --> 00:01:38.735
Bello: I'm strong!

24
00:01:39.035 --> 00:01:39.936
I can catch them.

25
00:01:39.956 --> 00:01:42.897
Tina: I know you're strong, Bello.

26
00:01:43.558 --> 00:01:45.559
But you're not as big as you used to be.

27
00:01:45.579 --> 00:01:49.421
Tina: We need something we can both hold, like a net.

28
00:01:49.501 --> 00:01:55.504
Tina: What about those?

29
00:01:56.385 --> 00:01:58.366
They look like they are made from spider web.

30
00:01:58.386 --> 00:02:00.067
Bello: They might work.

31
00:02:00.667 --> 00:02:02.248
We could combine two together.

32
00:02:02.828 --> 00:02:06.530
Tina: We could tie them together with the rope [n3@the mites used to tie our hands!

33
00:02:07.290 --> 00:02:10.211
Bello: Perfect!

34
00:02:14.573 --> 00:02:15.994
I'm so angry at Tina!

35
00:02:16.014 --> 00:02:20.075
Brad: Danny, we can't hold these mites back much longer.

36
00:02:20.095 --> 00:02:23.877
Brad: Maybe maybe we should just admit defeat.

37
00:02:23.897 --> 00:02:26.558
Danny: And let them capture us?

38
00:02:28.619 --> 00:02:29.619
Bello: Danny, Brad!

39
00:02:29.939 --> 00:02:30.820
Come to the window.

40
00:02:31.712 --> 00:02:32.813
Tina: It's safe to jump.

41
00:02:32.833 --> 00:02:35.074
Brad: That's Tina's voice!

42
00:02:36.095 --> 00:02:37.455
She is saying we should jump.

43
00:02:38.876 --> 00:02:39.316
Danny: Tina!

44
00:02:39.657 --> 00:02:41.558
She's the reason we are trapped up here.

45
00:02:42.358 --> 00:02:43.259
Can we trust her?

46
00:02:43.279 --> 00:02:44.619
Brad: I don't know.

47
00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:46.821
But we can't hold this door any longer.

48
00:02:46.841 --> 00:02:49.142
Brad: I don't think we have any choice.

49
00:02:51.884 --> 00:02:53.024
Brad: Danny!

50
00:02:53.064 --> 00:02:54.445
Danny: Okay.

51
00:02:54.805 --> 00:02:55.926
We'll let go together.

52
00:02:55.946 --> 00:02:58.427
Brad: One two three!

53
00:03:08.628 --> 00:03:08.969
Tina: Jump!

54
00:03:08.989 --> 00:03:09.791
Brad, Danny, jump!

55
00:03:09.851 --> 00:03:11.335
Danny: It's a long way down.

56
00:03:12.899 --> 00:03:15.646
Brad: It's now or never!

57
00:03:15.666 --> 00:03:17.290
Danny: Catch us!
